for a set of core skills that can carry through any sort of job changes. Things like communication and collaboration and stress management and leadership. These are things that are not trivial. They used to be called soft skills. No one calls them soft skills anymore. because we're realizing that they're essential. And working with automation, understanding probability, understanding statistical concepts, these are things that will always be needed and will probably become needed much, much more
掌握一套能够应对任何类型工作变化的核心技能。比如沟通、协作、压力管理和领导力。这些都不是微不足道的事情。它们过去被称为软技能。现在没有人称它们为软技能了，因为我们意识到它们至关重要。与自动化合作、理解概率、理解统计概念，这些都是永远需要的技能，而且随着我们能够自动执行诸如非例行体力劳动等事情，这些技能可能会变得更加重要

