saying, that these skills, like you can learn certain skills on the job or in school or through additional continuing education, but these personality, personal skills, the old soft skills, if you will, really will help people move into the future and sustain them as in the changing workforce. I think it's amazing what AI can do. And certainly robots can provide elder care. They can deliver lectures. One of my favorite experiments was done on a large online class. And one of the TAs was a bot and nobody knew and they loved her. They thought she was great. So AI can do a lot of things that maybe seem like interpersonal sorts of tasks. But, you know, a robot can't love you, Can't inspire you, can't persuade you, can't negotiate with you.
所说的，这些技能，就像你可以在工作中、在学校或通过继续深造学习某些技能一样，但这些个性、个人技能，如果你愿意的话，就是以前的软技能，确实会帮助人们迈向未来，并在不断变化的劳动力队伍中支撑他们。我认为人工智能所能做的事情令人惊叹。机器人当然可以提供老年护理。它们可以发表演讲。我最喜欢的一个实验是在一个大型在线班级中进行的。其中一位助教是一个机器人，没有人知道，他们非常喜欢她。他们认为她很棒。所以人工智能可以做很多看起来像人际交往任务的事情。但是，你知道，机器人不能爱你，不能激励你，不能说服你，不能与你谈判。

